## Major Modifications and New Features

- Multiplayer (2-player) battle mode
- Special brick system (hard bricks, vector bricks, bomb bricks, chain bricks, mother bricks)
- Power-up system (long paddle, extra life, speed down, tank ball, extra ball, shrink opponent)
- Leaderboard and score export functionality
- Recharge system
- Enhanced game UI and animations
- Score recording and CSV export

